bzip2-rs
========

A faithful Rust port of bzip2/libbzip2 1.0.8.

This product is a translation of the original bzip2 source code,
which is:

  Copyright (C) 1996-2019 Julian R Seward <jseward@acm.org>

The original bzip2 license text is preserved in LICENSE-upstream.
Portions of this product (the algorithmic structure, lookup tables,
and file-format constants) derive from that original work.
